      "quote": "Three meta-analyses have been conducted to provide synthesized evidence on the effectiveness of pharmacological interventions for depressive symptoms following stroke, but results were mixed. Three reviews have identified several NPIs for post-stroke depression and have qualitatively provided evidence. However, none of these reviews quantitatively demonstrated the effectiveness of different types of NPIs.",
